---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const canonicalUrl = 'https://calcumetrics.com/privacy-policy';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Calcumetrics" description="How Calcumetrics collects, uses, and protects your data, including our use of Google AdSense and analytics." canonical={canonicalUrl}>
  <div class="max-w-[700px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <p class="text-xs text-text-muted mb-2">Last updated: 20 September 2026</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text-primary mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">Effective date: 20 September 2026. This policy describes how Calcumetrics collects, uses, and shares information when you use our website.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">1. Who we are</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">Calcumetrics is an independent financial calculator website. Contact: <a href="mailto:hello@calcumetrics.com" class="text-accent hover:underline">hello@calcumetrics.com</a>.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">2. Calculator inputs</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">All calculator inputs are processed entirely in your browser. They are not transmitted to our servers, not stored, and not sent to any third party. Calculator state may be saved to your browser&rsquo;s URL hash (for share links) or localStorage (for remembered currency preference). This data stays on your device.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">3. Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">We use a <a href="/cookie-policy" class="text-accent hover:underline">cookie policy</a>. We plan to use Google AdSense, which sets advertising cookies. Before serving personalised ads to users in the EEA, UK, and Switzerland, we will implement a Google-certified consent management platform (CMP). See our <a href="/cookie-policy" class="text-accent hover:underline">Cookie Policy</a> and <a href="#" id="open-cookie-settings" class="text-accent hover:underline cursor-pointer">Cookie settings</a> to manage your preferences.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">4. Google AdSense</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">We plan to display ads via Google AdSense. Google uses cookies and device identifiers to serve relevant ads. You can opt out at <a href="https://optout.aboutads.info/" rel="noopener" class="text-accent hover:underline">aboutads.info</a> or via <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" rel="noopener" class="text-accent hover:underline">Google Ad Settings</a>. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener" class="text-accent hover:underline">how Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">5. Your rights</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">Depending on your location, you may have rights under GDPR/UK GDPR (access, correction, deletion, objection, portability, withdrawal of consent), India&rsquo;s DPDP Act 2023, or applicable US state laws. To exercise any right, contact us at hello@calcumetrics.com.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">6. Children</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">This site is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect data from children.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">7. Changes</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">We update this policy when our practices change. The effective date at the top reflects the date of the last change. Continued use of the site after a change constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
